  "description": "A convention-based object-to-object mapper for .NET. Compiles every mapping to an expression tree once, then reuses the delegate. Supports flattening, nested maps, collections, records, constructor injection, and ProjectTo over IQueryable. Ships Roslyn analyzers that report unmapped destination members at build time rather than as a startup exception.",
